{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_25951","headline":"秋怀五首 四 · 鲍溶","name":"秋怀五首 四","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"金气白日来，疎黄满河关。\n平居乏愉悦，况复身险艰。\n一忆故乡居，一望客人还。\n两心四海中，谁不伤朱颜。\n双燕不巢树，浮萍不出山。\n性命君由天，安得易其间。\n休悲砌虫苦，此日无人闲。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"鲍溶","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_25951.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_25951","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}